<title>CANADA: Laidlaw to sell Allied Waste interest.</title>
<headline>Laidlaw to sell Allied Waste interest.</headline>
<dateline>BURLINGTON, Ont. 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Laidlaw Inc said on Tuesday it planned to sell its interest in Allied Waste Industries Inc for a total transaction value of about US$376 million.</p>
<p>Laidlaw said it entered into a contract with Allied Waste, Apollo Investment Fund III LP and Blackstone Capital Partners II Merchant Banking Fund LP, under which Allied would buy the $150 million, 12-year, seven percent note, the $168.3 million zero coupon note and 20.4 million, 12-year warrants, exerciseable into Allied common shares at $8.25, from Laidlaw.</p>
</text>
